## Content Item Lifecycle

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Intake
    Intake --> Transcription
    Transcription --> ScenePlan
    ScenePlan --> Animation
    Animation --> Review
    Review --> Published
    Review --> Rejected
    Published --> Analytics
    Rejected --> [*]
    
    state Intake {
        [*] --> Webhook
        Webhook --> Metadata
        Metadata --> Classification
        Classification --> PUBLIC
        Classification --> REVIEW
        Classification --> PRIVATE
    }
```

## Publishing Flow

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ContentItem
    ContentItem --> ApprovalCheck
    ApprovalCheck --> Draft
    ApprovalCheck --> Approved
    Draft --> PostizAPI
    Approved --> PostizAPI
    PostizAPI --> Scheduled
    PostizAPI --> Published
    Scheduled --> Published
    Published --> Analytics
    Published --> Error
    Error --> Retry
    Retry --> PostizAPI
```

